{
  "question_text": "You are given a dataset that records scores submitted by team members for different projects. Each row represents a score given by a specific team member on a particular date.\r\n\r\nCompute the **average score for each project**, but only include projects that have been scored by **more than one team member**.\r\n\r\n**Input DataFrame:** `project_data`\r\n\r\n| Column Name     | Type           |\r\n| --------------- | -------------- |\r\n| project\\_id      | int64          |\r\n| team\\_member\\_id  | int64          |\r\n| score           | int64          |\r\n| date            | datetime64[ns] |\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary style=\"padding:8px 16px; background-color:#2196F3; color:white; border-radius:4px; cursor:pointer; display:inline-block; list-style:none;\">Preview Input Data</summary>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n|project\\_id|team\\_member\\_id|score|date|\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n|104|6|0|2024-07-19|\r\n|103|1|90|2024-09-02|\r\n|103|6|6|2024-08-23|\r\n|101|1|5|2024-07-25|\r\n|104|1|2|2024-09-13|\r\n|103|2|95|2024-08-29|\r\n|102|4|2|2024-10-07|\r\n|105|6|37|2024-08-30|\r\n|102|3|3|2024-08-26|\r\n|103|6|4|2024-10-14|\r\n|104|2|6|2024-09-23|\r\n|104|4|8|2024-08-17|\r\n|101|6|6|2024-10-14|\r\n|103|4|4|2024-08-23|\r\n|102|4|2|2024-08-24|\r\n|103|4|93|2024-08-14|\r\n|105|6|14|2024-10-13|\r\n|102|1|2|2024-10-12|\r\n|103|2|100|2024-10-02|\r\n|104|1|10|2024-07-27|\r\n|107|11|9|2024-11-02|\r\n|104|6|7|2024-10-15|\r\n|104|6|6|2024-10-07|\r\n|104|4|8|2024-09-17|\r\n|104|3|7|2024-10-04|\r\n|104|3|4|2024-09-05|\r\n|102|1|1|2024-08-17|\r\n|104|3|6|2024-08-04|\r\n|102|6|4|2024-08-17|\r\n|103|3|87|2024-08-15|\r\n|104|1|7|2024-09-11|\r\n|103|3|72|2024-07-30|\r\n|101|2|5|2024-10-14|\r\n|101|6|5|2024-09-13|\r\n|106|10|7|2024-11-01|\r\n|102|6|3|2024-08-22|\r\n|102|5|4|2024-08-06|\r\n|103|1|34|2024-08-03|\r\n|101|2|8|2024-09-22|\r\n|105|1|5|2024-07-18|\r\n|105|6|1|2024-07-09|\r\n|104|2|0|2024-08-29|\r\n|102|6|3|2024-09-04|\r\n|102|5|4|2024-07-16|\r\n|103|3|40|2024-07-23|\r\n|101|2|3|2024-09-24|\r\n|102|1|5|2024-08-04|\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n**Requirements**\r\n\r\n- Group scores by project\r\n- Only include projects scored by more than one **unique** team member\r\n- Calculate the average of all scores for each qualifying project\r\n- Round average_score to 2 decimal places\r\n- Use the provided `project_data` DataFrame as-is, do not modify or reconstruct the dataset\r\n\r\n**Returns**\r\n\r\n- `pandas.DataFrame` with columns:\r\n  - `project_id`: Unique identifier for each project\r\n  - `average_score`: Average of all scores submitted for that project",
